WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
- What did you think of?

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.900
'Cause you were a model,

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.030
so I'm just asking, what did you think?

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.107
- Very, very good.

00:00:05.107 --> 00:00:06.540
Very good.
- Yes, so creative!

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.170
- It's so creative and it's not easy,

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.330
especially now in the
days of Instagramming

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.840
and things like that.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.240
I enlist my husband to
do it a lot of the times.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.260
I had a background in modeling.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.330
Actually before I started
acting, I modeled.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:21.560
I was actually in Japan,

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.890
I was doing an ad for Sony of all things.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.340
And I had a monkey that I
was working with that day.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.580
His name was Dodo-chan.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.880
I'll never forget that name,

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:33.940
I promise.
(laughter)

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.640
And he was really, really sweet,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.500
running all over the place
and posing with me and on me.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.580
And then, we had our lunch break.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.950
And then, Dodo-chan saw--
- Like a spider monkey?

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.310
- Yeah, like a spider monkey.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.710
He was exactly, a little spider monkey.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.350
Don't be fooled by how cute they are.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.100
- Yeah, and so am I, girl.
- There was this big bowl

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.670
of fruit and everybody watched

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.850
as Dodo-chan just saw that bowl of fruit

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:56.450
and just dove into the
passion fruit and the kiwi

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.637
and all of them were like, "Oh, my god.

00:00:57.637 --> 00:00:59.340
"He loves the fruit, it's so great!"

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:01.949
And they were like, "All
right, everybody back to work."

00:01:01.949 --> 00:01:03.700
(groans)
And Dodo-chan decided

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.320
he wanted to pose on top of my head

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.930
and we thought that was super cute.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.270
- I know where this is going.
- Until,

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.610
you see there where this is going.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.637
Dodo-chan just completely
relieved himself.

00:01:13.637 --> 00:01:15.290
(horrified groans)
(laughs)

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.790
- Please, tell me the photo is somewhere!

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:18.630
- Let me tell you what.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:21.720
I'd gone back to Japan the following year.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:25.220
And there on the subway,
were the ads of me.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.910
And I remember looking at it,

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.250
'cause it was such a
(laughs) horrific day.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.570
But you wouldn't tell, I looked so happy

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.100
with Dodo-chan
(laughter)

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.230
sitting on my shoulder
and I was like this.

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:36.480
And little did anybody know.
- Well, you've gotten

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:37.430
really close.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.350
- We got really, really close.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.183
So, yes.

00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:41.310
- It's a different level of relationship

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.553
at that point.
(laughs)

